WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.675
Vinnie was relieved that he wasn’t punished.

2
00:00:05.676 --> 00:00:07.986
"I’m glad everything worked out,"

3
00:00:07.987 --> 00:00:13.741
said Rishi’s father, as they passed out of the arch and onto the street again.

4
00:00:13.742 --> 00:00:16.468
"What will you children do now?"

5
00:00:16.469 --> 00:00:19.503
Mandy remembered the photo.

6
00:00:19.504 --> 00:00:24.391
"Is there a river or lake nearby?" she asked.

7
00:00:24.392 --> 00:00:29.959
"You must mean the Ganges, the holy river," said Rishi.

8
00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:33.083
"I will take you there."

9
00:00:33.084 --> 00:00:38.898
They said good-bye to Rishi’s father, and the children walked down the road.

10
00:00:38.899 --> 00:00:41.870
Soon, they heard music.

11
00:00:41.871 --> 00:00:48.265
By the road, an elderly man sat on a straw mat playing a flute.

12
00:00:48.266 --> 00:00:52.386
In front of him was a round basket.

13
00:00:52.387 --> 00:00:56.071
"What is that man doing?" asked Vinnie.

14
00:00:56.072 --> 00:00:59.435
Suddenly, a snake appeared.

15
00:00:59.436 --> 00:01:02.410
It swayed to the music.

16
00:01:02.411 --> 00:01:06.600
"He’s a snake charmer," explained Rishi.

17
00:01:06.601 --> 00:01:12.412
The children watched the snake weave back and forth, hissing.

18
00:01:12.413 --> 00:01:16.924
"Come, here is the River Ganges," said Rishi.

19
00:01:16.925 --> 00:01:22.215
The children joined some people waiting for a boat on the riverbank.

20
00:01:22.216 --> 00:01:27.669
Once they were aboard, Mandy noticed pictures hanging everywhere.

21
00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:32.136
"Wow!" Mandy exclaimed.

22
00:01:32.137 --> 00:01:36.947
"This is a floating art gallery," explained Rishi.

23
00:01:36.948 --> 00:01:42.732
"People ride down the Ganges while they enjoy the drawings and paintings."

24
00:01:42.733 --> 00:01:46.151
"This one looks like a man with an elephant head,"

25
00:01:46.152 --> 00:01:49.904
Vinnie said, pointing to a picture.

26
00:01:49.905 --> 00:01:53.279
"That’s Ganesha," said Rishi.

27
00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:57.691
"He is our god of wisdom, science, and the arts."

28
00:01:57.692 --> 00:02:02.546
Vinnie and Mandy calmly watched the peaceful river.

29
00:02:02.547 --> 00:02:07.005
Along the shore, cattle were drinking lazily.

30
00:02:07.006 --> 00:02:13.359
Women filled jugs and then walked away, balancing them on their heads.

31
00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:18.738
"Mandy, the picture is glowing blue," whispered Vinnie.

32
00:02:18.739 --> 00:02:23.905
"Can you tell us about this river, Rishi?" asked Mandy.

33
00:02:23.906 --> 00:02:27.489
"This river is named for the goddess Ganga.

34
00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:33.261
She came to Earth and blessed these waters," began Rishi.

35
00:02:33.262 --> 00:02:38.791
"We believe that if we bathe in the river, our sins will be forgiven."

36
00:02:38.792 --> 00:02:41.734
The sun was about to set.

37
00:02:41.735 --> 00:02:45.538
A sudden splash caught their attention.

38
00:02:45.539 --> 00:02:52.791
"Rishi! What’s that?" asked Mandy, pointing.

39
00:02:52.792 --> 00:02:58.494
"Oh, those are the sacred dolphins of the Ganges," cried Rishi.

40
00:02:58.495 --> 00:03:02.018
"Why are they sacred?" asked Vinnie.

41
00:03:02.019 --> 00:03:07.868
"The dolphins are special friends of the goddess Ganga," said Rishi.

42
00:03:07.869 --> 00:03:10.995
"We don’t see them very often now.

43
00:03:10.996 --> 00:03:14.390
This is a special moment."

44
00:03:14.391 --> 00:03:19.588
Vinnie and Mandy watched as a dolphin swam closer.

45
00:03:19.589 --> 00:03:23.495
The photo was still glowing blue.

46
00:03:23.496 --> 00:03:27.261
"Thank you, Rishi," Vinnie said.

47
00:03:27.262 --> 00:03:30.389
"It’s been a wonderful journey."

48
00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:33.735
"Are you going home?" asked Rishi.

49
00:03:33.736 --> 00:03:39.475
The dolphin jumped out of the water, and the photo glowed red.

50
00:03:39.476 --> 00:03:43.619
"Yes, we are," replied Vinnie.

51
00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:50.756
The children fell down the dark tunnel and landed with a thump on the attic floor.

52
00:03:50.757 --> 00:03:53.361
"Where are you kids?

53
00:03:53.362 --> 00:04:00.264
I thought I told you to fold the laundry!" Mom shouted from downstairs.

54
00:04:00.265 --> 00:04:10.637
Grinning, Vinnie and Mandy went downstairs to finish their job.

